  },
  "body": "`autocomplete=street-address` isn’t allowed with `input type=text`—because the `street-address` field name is for a multiline street address. So, change example to use `texarea`, which does allow `autocomplete=street-address`.\n\nAlso, add note about `<input type=month autocomplete=\"bday\">` example being non-conforming (which it’s OK for it to be, since the section it’s in provides UA requirements and so is targeted to implementors, and  not intended for authors).\n",
